# Catppuccin Mocha — central palette.
#
# Each token has two forms:
#   <NAME>          = hex without leading "#" (e.g. cdd6f4)
#   <NAME>_R/G/B    = decimal RGB components, for templates that need
#                     rgba(R,G,B,A) overrides on alpha
#
# Templates throughout this repo (files ending in .tpl) reference these
# as @TOKEN@. apply.sh's render step substitutes them into the
# corresponding non-.tpl output before syncing to ~/.config/.
#
# To swap the whole desktop to e.g. Frappé, fork this file (or sed in
# new values) and re-run ./apply.sh.

# ── Accents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ROSEWATER=f5e0dc
ROSEWATER_R=245
ROSEWATER_G=224
ROSEWATER_B=220

